    {
      "id": "11-google-linking",
      "title": "Google account linking by email",
      "status": "plan-change",
      "version": "1.7.3",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/auth/sign-in/social",
        "body": {
          "provider": "google"
        },
        "config": {
          "accountLinking": {
            "enabled": true,
            "disableImplicitLinking": true,
            "trustedProviders": ["google"]
          }
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "status": 200,
        "location": "https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth?response_type=code&client_id=spike-google-client-id&state=KDsuYrey5iZU6IBxWDkXwMcnHUwPhJ7m&scope=email+profile+openid&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A8787%2Fauth%2Fcallback%2Fgoogle&prompt=consent&access_type=offline&code_challenge_method=S256&code_challenge=Ee49KkVye0m5i93QnAyemK6OJZtHOcy0NAZC2cpAjsc&include_granted_scopes=true",
        "body": {
          "url": "https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth?response_type=code&client_id=spike-google-client-id&state=KDsuYrey5iZU6IBxWDkXwMcnHUwPhJ7m&scope=email+profile+openid&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A8787%2Fauth%2Fcallback%2Fgoogle&prompt=consent&access_type=offline&code_challenge_method=S256&code_challenge=Ee49KkVye0m5i93QnAyemK6OJZtHOcy0NAZC2cpAjsc&include_granted_scopes=true",
          "redirect": true
        }
      },
      "notes": [
        "ADR-017 already forbids implicit same-email Google linking. A Google sign-in for an existing email must return account_not_linked unless the user called linkSocial() after a verified session.",
        "The phase file omitted disableImplicitLinking: true — absorb ADR-017 into PR 02.1 options.",
        "Live Google round-trip was not run (no real consent screen in this spike). Threat model: never link on unverified email match; disableImplicitLinking closes the account-takeover path."
      ]
    },
